graph LR
    MMS["ModelMesh Serving<br/>Operator"]

    %% External Dependencies (Required)
    MMS -->|model registry,<br/>VModel state,<br/>event coordination| etcd["etcd v3.5.x<br/>(Required)"]
    MMS -->|model placement,<br/>routing, serving<br/>(sidecar mm)| ModelMesh["ModelMesh<br/>(Required)"]
    MMS -->|model artifact<br/>retrieval<br/>(sidecar puller)| RuntimeAdapter["modelmesh-runtime-adapter<br/>(Required)"]

    %% External Dependencies (Optional)
    MMS -->|REST-to-gRPC<br/>translation<br/>(sidecar)| RESTProxy["REST Proxy<br/>(Optional)"]
    MMS -->|webhook TLS<br/>certificates| CertManager["cert-manager v1.x<br/>(Optional)"]
    MMS -->|ServiceMonitor<br/>CRD| PrometheusOp["Prometheus Operator v0.55+<br/>(Optional)"]

    %% Internal RHOAI Dependencies
    MMS -->|shared CRDs<br/>InferenceService| KServe["KServe<br/>(Internal RHOAI)"]
    MMS -.->|co-manages<br/>InferenceService| ODHModelCtrl["odh-model-controller<br/>(Internal RHOAI)"]
    MMS -->|auth proxy<br/>(sidecar)| OAuthProxy["OpenShift OAuth Proxy<br/>(Internal RHOAI)"]

    %% Runtime Images
    MMS -->|GPU inference<br/>keras, onnx, pytorch,<br/>tensorflow, tensorrt| Triton["Triton Inference Server<br/>(Runtime)"]
    MMS -->|Python inference<br/>sklearn, xgboost,<br/>lightgbm| MLServer["Seldon MLServer<br/>(Runtime)"]
    MMS -->|Intel inference<br/>openvino_ir, onnx| OVMS["OpenVINO Model Server<br/>(Runtime)"]
    MMS -->|PyTorch inference<br/>pytorch-mar| TorchServe["TorchServe<br/>(Runtime)"]

    %% Integration Points (inbound)
    Dashboard["RHOAI Dashboard"] -->|UI management,<br/>Grafana dashboards| MMS
    DSP["Data Science Pipelines"] -.->|auto deploy models| MMS

    %% External Services
    MMS -->|model storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS| S3["S3/GCS/Azure Storage"]
    MMS -->|CRD watch, CRUD<br/>443/TCP HTTPS| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    MMS -->|SCC restricted| SCC["OpenShift SCC"]
    MMS -->|HPA autoscaling| HPA["autoscaling/v2 HPA"]

    %% Styling
    style MMS fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px,color:#fff
    style etcd fill:#e74c3c,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style ModelMesh fill:#e74c3c,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style RuntimeAdapter fill:#e74c3c,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style RESTProxy fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style CertManager fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
